[6.596, "o", "gemini-3.8-flash ▸ \"[LIVE] Gross margin: $400.00 USD · VERIFIED\"\r\nThe receipt verdict is **VERIFIED** and the run verdict is **E2E_PUBLISH_CONNECTED**.\r\nRegarding whether the number can be trusted, the run verified the complete end-to-end governance path:\r\n1. The publication was first published in BigQuery (READY, head switched) and the Catalog entry was written from it.\r\n2. The requester's own Catalog read, the pinned publication, governed retrieval, fact read-back, and receipt were then verified.\r\n3. After access was revoked, a fresh request, a bypass, and the stored receipt were all refused.\r\nPlease note that the underlying data is a synthetic invented Acme fixture, the APIs are live GCP (BigQuery, Dataplex Catalog, IAM), and this reflects a single test run rather than operational readiness.\r\npublish (BigQuery is the authority)\r\n  states PLANNED → PREPARING → BQ_STAGED → BQ_COMMITTED → KC_APPLIED → COMPLETE · READY rows={'nodes': 44, 'edges': 109, 'sections': 22} · dataset okf_kp_publish_kp_"]
